/E (As you peruse this annual report, you will discover the many achievements of OVAH in the past year, and gain a renewed sense of hope for a safer and more equitable future for the children and women of Tanzania. Our success is a testament to what can be accomplished when we work together, and we are grateful for the support of our funders, including the We Are Family Foundation, the Mastercard Scholars Foundation, and the Women Fund Tanzania.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
