<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Our Voices Against Harassment is a non-profit organization based in Tanzania with the registration number 00NGO/R/2053 dedicated to ending sexual violence and creating a gender-just and violence-free society.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (We raise awareness about sexual violence in our societies, promote the culture of reporting sexual violence incidents, and work to eliminate negative social norms that perpetuate violence against women and girls, such as victimization. We empower women and girls in Tanzania by providing support services, changing societal norms, and providing education and self-defense training.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (With a focus on girls and women, who are disproportionately affected by sexual violence, OVAH's interventions are tailored to meet their unique needs and address the root causes of the problem. Additionally, OVAH works directly with marginalized groups that have experienced sexual assault, with the objective of empowering, educating, and supporting them on the path towards recovery and justice. Our ultimate goal is to bring an end to Gender-Based Violence and sexual violence in Tanzania.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
