/S /H2
/P 128 0 R
/T (SOCIAL JUSTICE This is a central part of our mission, to create a just, violence-free, and equitable Tanzania. We promote fairness and equity in society, where every individual is treated with respect and dignity regardless of race, gender, ethnicity, religion, socioeconomic status, or other personal characteristics. We aim to address systemic inequalities and injustices by advocating for the redistribution of resources and opportunities to ensure that all individuals have access to basic human rights, social services, and opportunities to reach their full potential.)
/E (SOCIAL JUSTICE This is a central part of our mission, to create a just, violence-free, and equitable Tanzania. We promote fairness and equity in society, where every individual is treated with respect and dignity regardless of race, gender, ethnicity, religion, socioeconomic status, or other personal characteristics. We aim to address systemic inequalities and injustices by advocating for the redistribution of resources and opportunities to ensure that all individuals have access to basic human rights, social services, and opportunities to reach their full potential.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
