/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 128 0 R
/T (SERVICE TO OTHERS We believe in the power of both grand gestures and small acts of kindness. Our team is steadfast in its commitment to creating a society that is free from gender-based violence and promotes gender equity in Tanzania. By collaborating with key stakeholders and dedicating ourselves to serving those in need, namely children, youths, women, and society as a whole, we strive to make a lasting impact. )
/E (SERVICE TO OTHERS We believe in the power of both grand gestures and small acts of kindness. Our team is steadfast in its commitment to creating a society that is free from gender-based violence and promotes gender equity in Tanzania. By collaborating with key stakeholders and dedicating ourselves to serving those in need, namely children, youths, women, and society as a whole, we strive to make a lasting impact. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
