/P 128 0 R
/T (IMPACT AND INNOVATION we are constantly seeking innovative solutions to the pressing issue of sexual violence in Tanzania. Our approach is focused on creating tangible, impactful change that drives social progress. To this end, we carefully evaluate and implement projects that are not only feasible but also yield measurable outcomes for the communities we serve. Our comprehensive, multi-faceted strategy ensures that we are making a meaningful and lasting difference in the fight against sexual violence. )
/E (IMPACT AND INNOVATION we are constantly seeking innovative solutions to the pressing issue of sexual violence in Tanzania. Our approach is focused on creating tangible, impactful change that drives social progress. To this end, we carefully evaluate and implement projects that are not only feasible but also yield measurable outcomes for the communities we serve. Our comprehensive, multi-faceted strategy ensures that we are making a meaningful and lasting difference in the fight against sexual violence. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
