/T (IACCOUNTABILITY AND CONFIDENTIALITY We hold ourselves accountable on the promise to create an environment in Tanzania in which sexual violence is not tolerated. We handle victims' and survivors' information in a highly confidential manner and allow them to receive the support they need without fear allowing them to receive justice and heal from the trauma. )
/E (IACCOUNTABILITY AND CONFIDENTIALITY We hold ourselves accountable on the promise to create an environment in Tanzania in which sexual violence is not tolerated. We handle victims' and survivors' information in a highly confidential manner and allow them to receive the support they need without fear allowing them to receive justice and heal from the trauma. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
