283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 128 0 R
/T (COLLECTIVE CARE We care about the well-being of our teammates as well as those we serve. We take the time to listen to and understand the needs of others as well as our own. We also prfioritize creating a society in which people support and protect one another from sexual violence. We promote empathy, compassion, and understanding towards others, and encourage individuals to take an active role in creating a more caring and supportive community. We recognise that individuals are interdependent and that we all have a responsibility to support and care for one another to build a stronger and healthier community.)
/E (COLLECTIVE CARE We care about the well-being of our teammates as well as those we serve. We take the time to listen to and understand the needs of others as well as our own. We also prfioritize creating a society in which people support and protect one another from sexual violence. We promote empathy, compassion, and understanding towards others, and encourage individuals to take an active role in creating a more caring and supportive community. We recognise that individuals are interdependent and that we all have a responsibility to support and care for one another to build a stronger and healthier community.)
/Pg 16 0 R
