284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 128 0 R
/T (GENDER MAINSTREAMING We address gender inequality and promote gender equity by ensuring that our work is inclusive and addresses the diverse needs and experiences of all individuals, regardless of gender and other intersectionalities. We are intentional in examining the ways in which gender affects violence, and developing strategies to address these issues. We ensure that our services and programs are tailored to the needs of all individuals who are affected by violence, regardless of their gender identity. We also promote gender equality and challenge harmful gender norms and stereotypes that contribute to violence. )
/E (GENDER MAINSTREAMING We address gender inequality and promote gender equity by ensuring that our work is inclusive and addresses the diverse needs and experiences of all individuals, regardless of gender and other intersectionalities. We are intentional in examining the ways in which gender affects violence, and developing strategies to address these issues. We ensure that our services and programs are tailored to the needs of all individuals who are affected by violence, regardless of their gender identity. We also promote gender equality and challenge harmful gender norms and stereotypes that contribute to violence. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
