386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 131 0 R
/E (In 2022, we successfully raised awareness of sexual violence in Tanzania by conducting workshops in schools. Our Sexual Violence Awareness and Prevention Workshops were held in 18 primary and secondary schools in Dar es Salaam, Arusha, and Zanzibar, impacting 1101 girls and 358 boys. During these workshops, we provided participants with valuable knowledge and information on various forms of sexual violence. Moreover, we helped them unlearn negative social norms and learn about different mediums to report sexual violence incidents.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
