<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 132 0 R
/T (Additionally, we organized a five-day workshop in the beautiful Wasa Village located in Iringa. This workshop was designed for thirty young girls and women aged between 14-20 years old, and boys and men aged between 16-23. We delved into crucial topics such as sex education, gender-based violence, boundaries, consent, and healthy relationships. We were honored to provide a safe and supportive space for the participants, particularly for those who were victims or survivors of sexual violence. With compassion and empathy, we offered them the necessary resources and tools to heal, move forward, and empower themselves. )
/E (Additionally, we organized a five-day workshop in the beautiful Wasa Village located in Iringa. This workshop was designed for thirty young girls and women aged between 14-20 years old, and boys and men aged between 16-23. We delved into crucial topics such as sex education, gender-based violence, boundaries, consent, and healthy relationships. We were honored to provide a safe and supportive space for the participants, particularly for those who were victims or survivors of sexual violence. With compassion and empathy, we offered them the necessary resources and tools to heal, move forward, and empower themselves. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
