428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (In 2021, we worked with the animators from Jamii Design to develop our first Animation series called Mwajuma Simama! The animation revolves around the main character, Mwajuma, and her experiences with Grooming, Consent, Sexual harassment, Rape, Victim-blaming, and other issues. The animation encourages victims to speak out about these incidents and urges society to create a better, violence-free environment for girls and women.We initially released and distributed the first two episodes of our animation series in 2021 and the remaining three episodes in 2022.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
429 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (The series has proven to be an incredibly effective tool that we utilize for outreach to influence mindset and behavioral change towards gender-based violence and sexual violence. We screened the animation to 1398 children and young women. Furthermore, we have reached a vast online audience of 180,654 individuals, with the most engaged age range being between 15-18 years old.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
