/P 133 0 R
/E (Mwajuma Simama's third episode depicts the shaming and blaming of victims in our society. Mwajuma can be seen debating whether or not to tell her mother what happened. Her mother notices her sadness and inquires as to what has happened. Mwajuma's mother, on the other hand, did not believe Mwajuma. She warns her not to bring it up ever again because her uncle is incapable of raping her, She thinks Mwajuma is lying.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [10]
>>
