466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (The first video discusses sexual corruption in Tanzanian universities and encourages students \(as well as other individuals such as workers in workplaces, etc.\) to be aware of the reporting structures in their institutions and outside of them in order to report sexual corruption. We also explained how sexual corruption affects victims and the nation as a whole.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
467 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
468 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (The second video is about child marriage and intimate-partner violence. The video depicts how early marriage steals young girls' dreams and puts them at a much higher risk of experiencing intimate partner violence in their marriages. We highlighted actions that viewers of the video could take to help eliminate child marriage and Intimate-Partner Violence in Tanzania.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
469 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 135 0 R
/T (CHILD MARRIAGE AND INTIMATE PARTNER  VIOLENCE)
