>>
endobj
471 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 135 0 R
/E (The third video is about Rape culture. Rape Culture is deeply rooted in patriarchy in our country. Actions such as blaming the victims of acts of violence, not asking for consent in sexual matters, justifying acts of violence in movies and music, seeing women's bodies as sex tools, saying victims wanted to be raped because of where they are or their clothes, placing responsibility on women prevent rape and say men will be men without any accountability. These are a few examples discussed in the video. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
