<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (During workshops in schools, we are honored to meet Youths passionate about promoting social justice and creating positive change in the world who asked to be part of the organization in a greater capacity. In June 2022, we managed to launch the Ambassador program with the aim to empower individuals passionate about a sexual violence-free society to raise awareness and advocate for change by providing capacity-building trainings and resources, guiding rhem step by step on how to advocate for this issue and create a positive impact in their communitie. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
572 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (As an organization, we believe that eliminating sexual violence harassment and gender inequalities in our societies is an issue that requires collaborative efforts from all types of stakeholders. The Ambassador program was created to increase the number of actors who can actively and positively act to create a safe and just society. We have so far registered 114 ambassadors from eight regions: Dar es Salaam, Dodoma, Morogoro, Zanzibar, Kagera, Mwanza, Mbeya and Arusha. We conduct in-person and virtual Training of Trainer sessions with the ambssadoes to equip them with the knowledge and skills they need to be effective agents of change..)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
