/P 141 0 R
/E (A significant number of sexual assault incidents remain unreported, primarily because of the fear of victim-blaming, insufficient knowledge of the procedures, and limited access to support centers and services. We collaborate with the best psychologists and legal personnel in the country to provide support services of counselling and legal advice to the victims and survivors of sexual violence so they heal and recover from the trauma of sexual violence. We recruited a total of 00 experienced and professional psychologists and 00 legal practitioners in different \(list regions\) to volunteer to deliver their services to the victims of sexual violence.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
