596 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 142 0 R
/E (In November 2022, We conducted the Sexual Violence Awareness and Prevention workshops in primary and secondary schools in Arusha. We conducted these workshops in 7 schools where we taught students how to recognise elements of sexual grooming, sexual harassment, assault, and the concept of consent, privacy and boundaries and how to get help if they are victims of sexual violence. We also provided self-defence training to all participants, girls and boys. The goal is to change society's attitudes & mindsets about sexual violence from young ages. These workshops allow us to inspire these young people to think in the right direction. One of our objectives for 2022 was to expand our in-person programs beyond Dar es Salaam. We obtained an expansion permit from TAMISEMI, which allowed us to expand our school-related program to other regions, beginning with Arusha.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
