618 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 143 0 R
/E (On 22 October, we hosted a commemoration event for the Internatioal Day of the girl Child: #MiminiMsichanaShujaa with the theme Times for Unstoppable Girls: To be Heard, Educated and Protected \(Nyakati za Msichana Shujaa: Asikilizwe, Aelimishwe na Alindwe\). This was our first event ever as an organisation! We collaborated with Ukweli Wangu, Sema Tanzania, and Hills Water to bring together 89 students from 8 schools and another 20 participants from various universities in Dar es Salaam. The event provided a platform for girls and stakeholders to engage in meaningful dialogue about girl rights, their challenges, and the way forward. The event included panel discussions, the screening of our new educational animation about GBV, a storytelling performance by participants, and exhibitions.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [9]
>>
