/P 145 0 R
/E (As a result of inadequate funding, staffing and resources, conducting long-term interventions or follow-up programs in various communities can be challenging, hindering the achievement of sustainable and long-term impact, such as changes in mindset and behavior. However, we recognize the importance of such impact and have made it an integral component of our programs to comprehend the unique needs of different communities. By doing so, we can effectively prevent and respond to instances of sexual violence, and ensure that our efforts have a significant and lasting impact on the communities we serve.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [5]
