/Title (SOCIAL JUSTICE This is a central part of our mission, to create a just, violence-free, and equitable Tanzania. We promote fairness and equity in society, where every individual is treated with respect and dignity regardless of race, gender, ethnicity, religion, socioeconomic status, or other personal characteristics. We aim to address systemic inequalities and injustices by advocating for the redistribution of resources and opportunities to ensure that all individuals have access to basic human rights, social services, and opportunities to reach their full potential.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2430 0 R
/Next 2455 0 R
>>
endobj
2447 0 obj
<<
/Title (GENDER MAINSTREAMING We address gender inequality and promote gender equity by ensuring that our work is inclusive and addresses the diverse needs and experiences of all individuals, regardless of gender and other intersectionalities. We are intentional in examining the ways in which gender affects violence, and developing strategies to address these issues. We ensure that our services and programs are tailored to the needs of all individuals who are affected by violence, regardless of their gender identity. We also promote gender equality and challenge harmful gender norms and stereotypes that contribute to violence.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2430 0 R
/Prev 2456 0 R
>>
