/Title (IMPACT AND INNOVATION we are constantly seeking innovative solutions to the pressing issue of sexual violence in Tanzania. Our approach is focused on creating tangible, impactful change that drives social progress. To this end, we carefully evaluate and implement projects that are not only feasible but also yield measurable outcomes for the communities we serve. Our comprehensive, multi-faceted strategy ensures that we are making a meaningful and lasting difference in the fight against sexual violence.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2430 0 R
/Prev 2446 0 R
/Next 2459 0 R
>>
endobj
2456 0 obj
<<
/Title (IACCOUNTABILITY AND CONFIDENTIALITY We hold ourselves accountable on the promise to create an environment in Tanzania in which sexual violence is not tolerated. We handle victims' and survivors' information in a highly confidential manner and allow them to receive the support they need without fear allowing them to receive justice and heal from the trauma.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2430 0 R
/Prev 2460 0 R
