/Title (SERVICE TO OTHERS We believe in the power of both grand gestures and small acts of kindness. Our team is steadfast in its commitment to creating a society that is free from gender-based violence and promotes gender equity in Tanzania. By collaborating with key stakeholders and dedicating ourselves to serving those in need, namely children, youths, women, and society as a whole, we strive to make a lasting impact.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2430 0 R
/Prev 2455 0 R
/Next 2460 0 R
>>
endobj
2460 0 obj
<<
/Title (COLLECTIVE CARE We care about the well-being of our teammates as well as those we serve. We take the time to listen to and understand the needs of others as well as our own. We also prfioritize creating a society in which people support and protect one another from sexual violence. We promote empathy, compassion, and understanding towards others, and encourage individuals to take an active role in creating a more caring and supportive community. We recognise that individuals are interdependent and that we all have a responsibility to support and care for one another to build a stronger and healthier community.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2430 0 R
